The project is named "SylAPI".
Bring in "net" as net.
Bring in "sys" as sys.

Print "Syl Enterprise API starting on http://localhost:8080".

Listen for HTTP on port 8080.

When a request hits "/api/user":
    Print "Received API request for /api/user".
    Attempt to read "user_db.json" as raw_data.
    
    If it fails:
        Print "Warning: user_db.json not found. Returning error response.".
        Create a Dictionary called error_resp.
        Set key "error" in error_resp to "Database missing.".
        Set key "suggestion" in error_resp to "Please create user_db.json".
        Set json_output to JSON from error_resp.
        Reply with json_output.
        
    If it succeeds:
        Print "Database loaded successfully.".
        Set user_dict to Dictionary from JSON raw_data.
        Set key "status" in user_dict to "Active".
        Set final_json to JSON from user_dict.
        Reply with final_json.
